Description:It is your first main phase. You have Sram's Expertise, Eldritch Evolution and Shock in hand, with four white mana floating. Your library holds Grizzly Bears and two Colossal Dreadmaws. End the turn with Grizzly Bears on the battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-8fb57f2e587a6681 | A resolving spell's instructions are followed in order (CR 608.2c): Sram's Expertise creates the Servos before you cast the free spell, so Eldritch Evolution can sacrifice a Servo (mana value 0) for Grizzly Bears
